---
interface Props { data: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="pregnancy-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Embarazo</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Semanas</div><div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Calculadora de embarazo</span><h1>Tu embarazo,<br>semana a<br>semana.</h1><p>Descubrí tu edad gestacional, trimestre, fecha probable de parto y qué está pasando en esta etapa.</p><div class="chips"><span>📅 Regla de Naegele</span><span>♡ Criterio obstétrico</span><span>🔒 Datos privados</span></div><div class="baby-art"><div class="orb"></div><div class="week-slip"><small>HOY ESTÁS DE</small><strong>24 semanas</strong><span>Segundo trimestre</span></div><span class="due-tag">Faltan 111 días para conocerse</span></div></div>
<form class="calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Calculá tus semanas</h2><p>Empezamos por tu última menstruación.</p></div><span class="tag">Orientativo</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Cómo querés calcularlo?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="fum"><i>📅</i>Última menstruación</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="conception"><i>♡</i>Fecha de concepción</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="ultrasound"><i>🩺</i>Por ecografía</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="twins"><i>👶👶</i>Embarazo múltiple</button></div><div class="section-label">Tus datos</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label id="date-label">Primer día de tu última menstruación</label><input id="start-date" type="date" value="2026-02-09"></div><div class="field"><label>Fecha para calcular</label><input id="today-date" type="date" value="2026-07-28"></div><div class="field"><label>Duración habitual del ciclo</label><select id="cycle"><option>26</option><option selected>28</option><option>30</option><option>32</option><option>35</option></select></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ No guardamos ninguna fecha</span><button type="button" id="advanced-toggle">+ Datos de ecografía</button></div><div class="extra" id="extra-fields"><div class="field"><label>Fecha de la ecografía</label><input id="scan-date" type="date" value="2026-04-06"></div><div class="field"><label>Edad estimada en esa ecografía</label><select id="scan-week"><option value="8">8 semanas</option><option value="10">10 semanas</option><option value="12" selected>12 semanas</option><option value="14">14 semanas</option><option value="20">20 semanas</option></select></div></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Tu edad gestacional estimada</small><div class="weeks" id="result-weeks">24 semanas · 1 día</div></div><div class="due-card"><small>Fecha probable de parto</small><strong id="due-date">16 nov. 2026</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Trimestre<b id="trimester">Segundo</b></span><span>Mes aproximado<b id="month">6.º mes</b></span><span>Días para la FPP<b id="days-left">111 días</b></span></div><button class="go" id="update" type="button">Actualizar embarazo</button></section></form>
</div></section>
<section class="progress"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>El recorrido completo</span><h2>Tu lugar dentro de las 40 semanas</h2><p>Los trimestres ayudan a ordenar controles y cambios. Cada embarazo puede avanzar con tiempos distintos.</p></header><div class="preg-track"><i class="marker" id="marker"></i></div><div class="trim-grid"><article class="trim"><small>SEMANA 1 A 13+6</small><b>Primer trimestre</b><p>Formación inicial, primeras ecografías y datación.</p></article><article class="trim active"><small>SEMANA 14 A 27+6</small><b>Segundo trimestre</b><p>Movimientos, ecografía morfológica y crecimiento sostenido.</p></article><article class="trim"><small>DESDE SEMANA 28</small><b>Tercer trimestre</b><p>Maduración, aumento de peso y preparación para el nacimiento.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="this-week"><div class="wrap week-grid"><article class="card baby-card"><div class="fruit">🌽</div><div><span>Tu bebé esta semana</span><h2>Similar a una mazorca</h2><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><small>Longitud</small><b>30 cm</b></div><div class="metric"><small>Peso</small><b>600 g</b></div></div></div></article><article class="card milestones"><span>Semana 24</span><h3>Qué puede estar pasando ahora</h3><div class="milestone"><i>👂</i><div><b>Reconoce sonidos</b><p>El sistema auditivo sigue madurando y puede responder a voces.</p></div></div><div class="milestone"><i>🫁</i><div><b>Los pulmones continúan su desarrollo</b><p>Empiezan procesos importantes para respirar fuera del útero.</p></div></div><div class="milestone"><i>〰️</i><div><b>Movimientos más claros</b><p>Muchas personas ya perciben patrones de actividad.</p></div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="calendar"><div class="wrap cal-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Próximos hitos</span><h2>Las fechas que conviene tener a mano.</h2><p>La calculadora ordena referencias generales. Tu equipo de salud define los controles según tu historia clínica y evolución.</p></div><div class="dates"><div class="date"><small>INICIO 3.º TRIMESTRE</small><b>24 ago. 2026</b><span>Semana 28</span></div><div class="date"><small>EMBARAZO A TÉRMINO</small><b>26 oct. 2026</b><span>Desde semana 37</span></div><div class="date primary"><small>FECHA PROBABLE</small><b id="due-date-2">16 nov. 2026</b><span>Semana 40</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="notice"><div class="wrap notice-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#c9b5ff">Una referencia, no un diagnóstico</span><h2>La ecografía temprana puede ajustar las fechas.</h2><p>Si tus ciclos son irregulares o no recordás la FUM, la ecografía del primer trimestre suele ser la referencia más confiable para datar.</p></div><div class="notice-card"><div><small>PRIMERA ECOGRAFÍA</small><b>8–12 semanas</b><span>Datación inicial</span></div><div><small>DURACIÓN ESTÁNDAR</small><b>40 semanas</b><span>Desde la FUM</span></div><div><small>NACE EN LA FPP</small><b>≈ 4%</b><span>Es una fecha estimada</span></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap">
    <div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div>
    <aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside>
  </section>
</div>
<script is:inline>

const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),day=86400000,fmt=d=>new Intl.DateTimeFormat("es-AR",{day:"numeric",month:"short",year:"numeric"}).format(d),read=v=>{const[y,m,d]=v.split("-").map(Number);return new Date(y,m-1,d)};let activeCase="fum";
function calculate(){let start=read($("#start-date").value),today=read($("#today-date").value),cycle=Number($("#cycle").value)||28;if(activeCase==="conception")start=new Date(start.getTime()-14*day);if(activeCase==="ultrasound"){const scan=read($("#scan-date").value),weeks=Number($("#scan-week").value);start=new Date(scan.getTime()-weeks*7*day)}const adjusted=new Date(start.getTime()+(cycle-28)*day),elapsed=Math.max(0,Math.floor((today-adjusted)/day)),weeks=Math.floor(elapsed/7),days=elapsed%7,due=new Date(adjusted.getTime()+280*day),left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((due-today)/day)),trim=weeks<14?"Primer":weeks<28?"Segundo":"Tercer",month=Math.max(1,Math.min(9,Math.ceil(weeks/4.345)));$("#result-label").textContent=activeCase==="twins"?"Edad gestacional · embarazo múltiple":activeCase==="ultrasound"?"Edad gestacional según ecografía":"Tu edad gestacional estimada";$("#result-weeks").textContent=`${weeks} semanas · ${days} ${days===1?"día":"días"}`;$("#due-date").textContent=fmt(due);$("#due-date-2").textContent=fmt(due);$("#trimester").textContent=trim;$("#month").textContent=`${month}.º mes`;$("#days-left").textContent=`${left} días`;$("#marker").style.left=`${Math.min(100,weeks/40*100)}%`;$("#marker").style.setProperty("--week",`'Semana ${weeks}'`)}
document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");activeCase=b.dataset.case;$("#date-label").textContent=activeCase==="conception"?"Fecha estimada de concepción":"Primer día de tu última menstruación";if(activeCase==="ultrasound")$("#extra-fields").classList.add("open");calculate()}));document.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(i=>i.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("#advanced-toggle").addEventListener("click",e=>{$("#extra-fields").classList.toggle("open");e.currentTarget.textContent=$("#extra-fields").classList.contains("open")?"− Ocultar ecografía":"+ Datos de ecografía"});$("#update").addEventListener("click",e=>{calculate();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Embarazo actualizado";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar embarazo",1200)});calculate();

</script>
<style>
.pregnancy-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#10223c;background:#fff}

*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#172039;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
.top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e2ea;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#24324b;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:13px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#465269}.tools span{border:1px solid #dedde5;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#24324b;color:#fff;border-color:#24324b}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#faf8ff 0%,#faf8ff 57%,#fff3ef 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#7b788a;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#8767c9}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8767c9;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#8767c9}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#172039}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#62677b;max-width:505px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2dfe8;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#5e6072;font-size:10px}
.baby-art{height:240px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.orb{position:absolute;left:58px;top:17px;width:184px;height:184px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 34%,#fff 0 15%,#f7d8d2 16% 31%,#eec2bb 32% 47%,#dca9c7 48% 100%);border:11px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 24px 50px #5f45651b}.orb:after{content:"♡";position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:68px;font-weight:300}.week-slip{position:absolute;right:27px;top:39px;width:186px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0dce7;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 42px #47384f16;transform:rotate(2deg)}.week-slip small{font-size:8px;color:#706f80}.week-slip strong{display:block;font-size:26px;color:#6f52b0;margin:7px 0 10px}.week-slip span{font-size:9px;color:#a05266;background:#fdecef;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:99px}.due-tag{position:absolute;left:4px;bottom:14px;background:#eee8ff;color:#6950a5;border:1px solid #dcd1f7;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
.calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0dce7;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #47385816;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#6f7181;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#7655b8;background:#eee8ff;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#34334a;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #e1dee7;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;color:#5f6074;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:66px}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #8a68ce;background:#f5f1ff;color:#674aa7}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #e1dee7;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#6c6d7e;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#24243c;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#626579;font-size:9px}.advanced button{border:0;background:none;color:#7758b7;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:0}.extra{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px}.extra.open{display:grid}.result{background:#29314d;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#cbd0df}.weeks{font-size:33px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.due-card{background:#fdecef;color:#914c60;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.due-card small{color:inherit}.due-card strong{display:block;font-size:14px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #49516c;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#c2c8d6}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8966cd,#d87991);color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px}
.progress{padding:74px 0 67px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8767c9;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#696b7d;line-height:1.6}.preg-track{height:18px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eee8ff 0 33%,#fdecef 33% 67%,#e5f4ef 67% 100%);position:relative;margin:64px 24px 24px}.marker{position:absolute;left:60%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#8966cd;border:6px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 6px 15px #65469d42}.marker:before{content:"Semana 24";position:absolute;bottom:35px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;background:#29314d;color:#fff;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:7px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}.trim-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.trim{border:1px solid #e1dee7;border-radius:14px;padding:18px}.trim.active{border:2px solid #d87991;background:#fff9fa}.trim small{font-size:8px;color:#777789}.trim b{display:block;font-size:15px;margin:6px 0}.trim p{font-size:9px;color:#686b7d;line-height:1.5;margin:0}
.this-week{background:#faf7ff;padding:68px 0}.week-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.86fr 1.14fr;gap:20px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e1dee7;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #4738580b}.baby-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:115px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center}.fruit{width:112px;height:112px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0e8ff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:54px}.baby-card span,.milestones>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8767c9;font-weight:850}.baby-card h2{font-size:29px;margin:8px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.metrics{display:flex;gap:9px}.metric{background:#f7f5fa;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 12px}.metric small{display:block;font-size:8px;color:#707183}.metric b{font-size:13px}.milestones h3{font-size:20px;margin:8px 0 15px}.milestone{display:flex;gap:12px;margin:13px 0}.milestone i{font-style:normal;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#fdecef;display:grid;place-items:center}.milestone b{display:block;font-size:10px}.milestone p{font-size:9px;color:#6b6d7f;margin:3px 0 0;line-height:1.4}
.calendar{padding:69px 0}.cal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.78fr 1.22fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.cal-grid h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 14px}.cal-grid p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#696b7d}.dates{border:1px solid #e1dee7;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.date{background:#f8f6fb;border-radius:11px;padding:16px}.date small{display:block;color:#727385;font-size:8px}.date b{display:block;font-size:16px;margin:7px 0}.date span{font-size:8px;color:#696b7c}.date.primary{background:#eee8ff;color:#62459f}.notice{background:#29314d;color:#fff;padding:66px 0}.notice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.76fr 1.24fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.notice h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 13px}.notice p{color:#cbd0df;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}.notice-card{background:#fff;color:#29314d;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.notice-card div{background:#f7f5fa;border-radius:11px;padding:15px;text-align:center}.notice-card small{display:block;color:#6f7082;font-size:8px}.notice-card b{display:block;font-size:17px;margin:7px 0}.notice-card span{font-size:8px;color:#686a7c}.foot{height:110px}
@media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.week-grid,.cal-grid,.notice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.baby-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.orb{left:20px}.week-slip{right:0}.fields,.extra{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats,.trim-grid,.dates,.notice-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.baby-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center}.fruit{margin:auto}.metrics{justify-content:center}}

.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#1769bd;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#65798d;margin-top:4px}
@media(max-width:800px){.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
